---
title: About page
layout: home
description: The page that answers "who is this" in the first sentence and proves it in the next ten. A picture, a claim, the evidence, and one way to get in touch.
eyebrow: Pages
source: src/layout/page.css · components/widget.css
---
<section class="im-section im-wrap" style="padding-top: 1.5rem; --im-section-gap: 1.5rem">
	<p class="im-eyebrow">Pages · {{page.title}}</p>
	<p class="im-lede">{{page.description}}</p>
	<p class="doc-source"><code>{{page.source}}</code></p>
</section>

<div class="im-single im-wrap-wide" data-sidebar="off">
	<article class="im-stack" style="--im-stack-gap: 2rem">
		<header class="im-abouthero">
			<img class="im-abouthero-face" src="{{demo.author.profile_image}}" alt="" loading="eager">
			<div class="im-stack" style="--im-stack-gap: .75rem">
				<p class="im-eyebrow">About</p>
				<h1 class="im-collhead-title">I build things for the web and write down what they cost.</h1>
				<p class="im-lede" style="margin: 0">Eight years of Salesforce consulting, four of them freelance, and a design system I am selling because I got tired of paying for ones I could not modify. Currently in Amsterdam.</p>
				<p class="im-cluster" style="--im-cluster-gap: .5rem">
					<a class="im-btn im-btn-primary im-btn-sm" href="/pages/contact/">{{icon "mail"}}Get in touch</a>
					<a class="im-btn im-btn-sm" href="/pages/now/">{{icon "zap"}}What I am doing now</a>
					<a class="im-btn im-btn-sm" href="#">{{icon "download"}}CV</a>
				</p>
			</div>
		</header>

		<div class="im-tripstats">
			<span class="im-tripstat">{{icon "briefcase"}}<strong data-im-count>8</strong><span>Years consulting</span></span>
			<span class="im-tripstat">{{icon "folder"}}<strong data-im-count>{{demo.projects.length}}</strong><span>Projects</span></span>
			<span class="im-tripstat">{{icon "pencil"}}<strong data-im-count>34</strong><span>Posts this year</span></span>
			<span class="im-tripstat">{{icon "users"}}<strong data-im-count>4,210</strong><span>Readers</span></span>
			<span class="im-tripstat">{{icon "map-pin"}}<strong data-im-count>6</strong><span>Countries</span></span>
		</div>

		<section class="im-section" style="--im-section-gap: 1rem">
			<h2 class="im-caption" data-index="do">What I do</h2>
			<div class="im-grid-auto" style="--im-grid-min: 15rem">
				<div class="im-card im-card-outline"><span class="im-card-title">{{icon "zap"}} Salesforce consulting</span><span>Eight years, mostly public sector, mostly the programmes that are already late when I arrive.</span></div>
				<div class="im-card im-card-outline"><span class="im-card-title">{{icon "component"}} Design systems & themes</span><span>This one, and the theme on top of it. Both for sale, both what this site runs on.</span></div>
				<div class="im-card im-card-outline"><span class="im-card-title">{{icon "pencil"}} Writing & film</span><span>A post a fortnight, a letter to go with it, and a film most Thursdays.</span></div>
				<div class="im-card im-card-outline"><span class="im-card-title">{{icon "graduation-cap"}} Teaching</span><span>Three courses, filmed and written, with every source file.</span></div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="im-content im-content-flush im-content-lede">
			<p>I started writing this site because I kept answering the same questions in Slack and wanted somewhere to point. It turned into the thing I am best known for, which was not the plan and has been better than the plan.</p>
		</section>

		<section class="im-story" aria-label="The story so far">
			<p class="im-story-year">2012</p>
			<div class="im-story-chapter"><h2>A degree I do not use</h2><p>Computer science, in a college I liked, in a subject I was only ever adequate at. The useful part was the four years of writing things down for people who were not in the room.</p></div>
			<p class="im-story-year">2016</p>
			<div class="im-story-chapter"><h2>A startup that did not survive contact with its market</h2><p>CRM for small clinics. The market was real; our timing was not. The write-up of why is the most-read thing on this site, which is either encouraging or not.</p><img src="{{demo.shots.[2]}}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
			<p class="im-story-year">2018</p>
			<div class="im-story-chapter"><h2>Four years inside a consultancy</h2><p>Learning what not to do, at scale, on somebody else's budget. Three multi-year programmes and one habit I kept: every engagement ends with a document a stranger can act on.</p></div>
			<p class="im-story-year">2022</p>
			<div class="im-story-chapter"><h2>On my own, two days a week</h2><p>Six weeks at a time. Anything longer and I become staff, which is not what either of us is paying for. Roughly a third of the first conversations end with "you do not need me", and those become the next referral.</p></div>
			<p class="im-story-year">2026</p>
			<div class="im-story-chapter"><h2>A design system I would buy</h2><p>The site ran on a paid theme whose licence forbade resale. Nine months later it runs on <a href="/">this</a>, every line owned, and the thing is in the <a href="/collections/shop/">shop</a>. The <a href="/collections/timeline/">timeline</a> has the rest in order.</p><img src="{{demo.shots.[0]}}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
		</section>

		<section class="im-section" style="--im-section-gap: 1rem">
			<h2 class="im-caption" data-index="now">Right now</h2>
			<ul class="im-widget-now" style="max-width: 40rem">
				<li>{{icon "component"}}<span>Building <b>Im Design System v0.7</b> — the collections and the theme on top of them.</span></li>
				<li>{{icon "map-pin"}}<span>In <b>Amsterdam</b> until February; Tromsø after that.</span></li>
				<li>{{icon "book-open"}}<span>Reading <b>The Timeless Way of Building</b>, slowly, for the second time.</span></li>
			</ul>
		</section>

		<section class="im-section" style="--im-section-gap: 1rem">
			<h2 class="im-caption" data-index="work">Selected work</h2>
			<div class="im-repos" style="--im-repos-min: 18rem">
				{{#each demo.projects}}{{#match @index "<" 3}}{{> "components/repo-card" cta=true}}{{/match}}{{/each}}
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="im-widget im-widget-accent" style="max-width: 40rem">
			<h2 class="im-widget-title">Work with me</h2>
			<p class="im-widget-heading">Two days a week, from November.</p>
			<p class="im-cluster" style="--im-cluster-gap: .5rem"><a class="im-btn im-btn-primary" href="/pages/contact/">{{icon "mail"}}Start a conversation</a><a class="im-btn" href="/pages/resume/">{{icon "file-text"}}The résumé</a></p>
		</section>
	</article>

	<aside>
		<div class="im-sticky-rail">
			<div class="im-widgets">
				<section class="im-widget" aria-labelledby="ab-now">
					<h2 class="im-widget-title" id="ab-now">Right now <a href="/pages/now/">More</a></h2>
					<ul class="im-widget-now">
						<li>{{icon "component"}}<span>Building <b>Im Design System v0.7</b>.</span></li>
						<li>{{icon "map-pin"}}<span>In <b>Amsterdam</b> until February.</span></li>
						<li>{{icon "book-open"}}<span>Reading <b>The Timeless Way of Building</b>.</span></li>
					</ul>
				</section>

				<section class="im-widget im-widget-hire" aria-labelledby="ab-hire">
					<h2 class="im-widget-title" id="ab-hire">Hire me</h2>
					<p class="im-widget-hire-state" data-state="available">Two days a week, from November</p>
					<ul class="im-widget-hire-list">
						<li>{{icon "component"}}<span>Design systems and the Ghost themes on top of them.</span></li>
						<li>{{icon "gauge"}}<span>Making a slow site fast, with the numbers to show it.</span></li>
					</ul>
					<a class="im-btn im-btn-primary im-btn-sm" href="/pages/contact/">{{icon "mail"}}Start a conversation</a>
				</section>

				<section class="im-widget" aria-labelledby="ab-where">
					<h2 class="im-widget-title" id="ab-where">Elsewhere</h2>
					<ul class="im-widget-list">
						<li><a href="#">GitHub<small>Everything open</small></a></li>
						<li><a href="#">LinkedIn<small>The formal version</small></a></li>
						<li><a href="#">YouTube<small>128k subscribers</small></a></li>
					</ul>
				</section>

				<section class="im-widget im-widget-fill" aria-labelledby="ab-sub">
					<h2 class="im-widget-title" id="ab-sub">The letter</h2>
					<p class="im-widget-heading">A post a fortnight, and what it cost.</p>
					{{> "components/subscribe" id="about-email" button="Join"}}
				</section>
			</div>
		</div>
	</aside>
</div>

<section class="im-section im-wrap"><div class="im-prose">
<p>A face, one claim, the numbers that back it, a way in — then the story as <code>im-story</code>: a sticky year on the left, a chapter on the right, a picture where one exists. The rail is Now, Hire me, Elsewhere and the letter.</p>
</div></section>
